            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Core_Question_1__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>As compared with last quarter, how do you foresee your business in this quarter - Branded?</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Core_Question_2__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Please list %, or units, or amount that is incremental or decremental - Branded?</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Core_Question_3__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>Do you have any project or opportunity in this quarter?</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Core_Question_4__c</field>
            <value>
